**Test:** `ImportOrders_FromCsv_ParsesCorrectly` (line 140)
**Problem:** `File.ReadAllText(@"C:\TestData\orders.csv")` couples the test to an external file on a Windows-specific absolute path.

```csharp
// ❌ Current — external file dependency
